<header class="pack-intro">
  <h1>Paralliverse</h1>
  <p>Stable packing joins rows of unsigned 32-bit words. It keeps the order and duplicates, and skips empty rows. Edit the rows to run the Lean function in your browser.</p>
</header>

<section class="pack-card pack-editor" aria-labelledby="input-heading">
  <div class="pack-heading">
    <h2 id="input-heading"><label for="source">Input rows</label></h2>
    <label for="example">Example <select id="example">
      <option value="custom" disabled>Custom input</option>
      <option value="mixed" selected>Mixed rows</option>
      <option value="empty">Empty rows</option>
      <option value="none">Zero rows</option>
    </select></label>
  </div>
  <textarea id="source" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="input-help">[
  [],
  [8, 3],
  [],
  [8, 0],
  [4294967295, 3]
]</textarea>
  <p class="pack-note" id="input-help">Use decimal integers from 0 to 4294967295. Each input can contain up to 128 rows and 1,024 words.</p>
  <p class="pack-status" id="input-status" role="status">Loading the CPU runtime…</p>
</section>

